# How to contribute to the project

## Structure

*.github/workflows* - how does GH actins make bianry file
*audits/* 
    audit.py - you make this **before** PR between your last commit and PR. After this, special file is generated, that is for the maintainers. You may be asked few questions.
*src* - code of project
*.future* - the vision of the project. It is more like a vision rather than features, that are in GH issues, but are welcomed here too.
*tests/* - tests. These are done with audits automatically, you dont need to get there.

## Audits

You need to generate 'audit'. This is for maintainers to have structured code, it bypasses test for you and other staff, that is automated.

If you have some questions, feel free to ask.
